Z||000000||reddog||11-15-2001||05:31 PM||||Can anyone post a diagram of the plug wire routing from Distributor to each cylinder. Also a firing order for distributor and cylinder. Thanks<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Picturenew_sig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||JohnF||11-15-2001||05:59 PM||||4 or 6?<P>Firing order for 4 is 1-3-4-2<P>Firing order for 6 is 1-2-3-4-5-6<P>Cable routing is more difficult.  Maybe someone has a good pic they can post.  Otherwise, go to your friendly Haynes manual for some good pictures.||||reg||1
